  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim.",
    "The universe is still degenerate in the following ways, and this edit closes none of them -- it is a provenance re-record. The gate sweeps are 100 percent passive-control and submit no god verb. Nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs in any committed sweep and no summon is ever created. Scribing still stops when the materials stock empties. Teaching does not die out once the founding grants are taught: over the reference two hundred years a lesson is taught in every one of the ten twenty-year windows, the thinnest holding 16.",
